{"id":"chatcmpl-69afed45-14a5-4b98-b0c0-7a043dcc3909","object":"chat.completion","created":1795251872,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a cross-validation strategy for medical image interpretation: querying multiple independent expert models on the same visual question and requiring agreement before committing to an answer. The key insight is that lateral-view anatomy requires explicit reasoning about relative positions of structures (hemidiaphragms) rather than relying on a single model's output. The pattern generalizes to any binary visual-diagnosis task where spatial/anatomical reasoning is needed.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a visual question requires anatomical/spatial reasoning, explicitly ask the model to describe relative positions of relevant structures rather than just naming a finding.\",\n    \"Use two or more independent expert models on the same question and treat concordance as confidence; discordance signals need for further probing.\",\n    \"Match the query to the image view (e.g., lateral vs. frontal) and include view-specific landmarks in the prompt to reduce ambiguity.\",\n    \"For binary choice tasks, have each model state which option it supports so agreement can be checked directly against the answer options.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Specify the imaging view and relevant anatomical landmarks in the prompt; ask for relative-position descriptions, not just labels.\",\n    \"Multi-model consensus\": \"Query at least two independent expert tools with the same question; accept the answer only when they agree, otherwise re-query with disambiguating detail.\",\n    \"Binary visual classification\": \"Frame prompts so each model must commit to one of the given options, enabling direct concordance checks.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm both expert models independently selected the same answer option before finalizing.\",\n    \"Verify the prompt referenced the correct image view and anatomical landmarks relevant to the finding.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":476,"total_tokens":839,"completion_tokens":363,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":476},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":363}}}